{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps. Step 1, my cart: Espresso beans $24 x1, Ceramic mug $12 x2, Canvas tote $18 x1, with quantities I can change and the subtotal. Step 2, shipping: name, address, city, postcode and email, all required, with a message under a field that is empty or an email without an @. Step 3, payment summary: a choice of Standard delivery ($4, 3 to 5 working days) or Express ($12, next working day) that changes the total, subtotal plus delivery. Then a confirmation with an order number, my name, my email and the total I paid. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"ChatCard \"Checkout\" \"Three quick steps\" icon:\"shopping_bag\" status:\"Step {step} of 3\" w:390\n  state step=1\n  state placed=false\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Espresso beans\",\"detail\":\"$24 each\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"beans\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Ceramic mug\",\"detail\":\"$12 each\",\"price\":12,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"mug\",\"tone\":\"sky\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Canvas tote\",\"detail\":\"$18 each\",\"price\":18,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"tote\",\"tone\":\"mint\"}]\n  state name=\"\"\n  state address=\"\"\n  state city=\"\"\n  state postcode=\"\"\n  state email=\"\"\n  state ship=\"Standard\"\n  state tried=false\n  if !placed\n    Steps steps:[\"Cart\",\"Shipping\",\"Payment\"] current:=step\n    if step==1\n      SectionLabel \"Your cart\" \"{sum(items,x=>x.qty)} items\"\n      each i in items\n        CartLine \"{i.title}\" \"{i.detail}\" price:=money(i.price*i.qty,\"$\",2) qty:=i.qty kind:=i.kind tone:=i.tone -> items=updateWhere(items,x=>x.id==i.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n      Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2)]]\n      TotalBar \"Subtotal\" \"Before delivery\" amount:=money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2) cta:\"Shipping\" enabled:=sum(items,x=>x.qty)>0 -> step=2\n    if step==2\n      SectionLabel \"Shipping\" \"All required\"\n      InputField \"Full name\" \"Ada Lovelace\" =name error:=(tried&&trim(name)==\"\")?\"Name is required\":\"\"\n      InputField \"Address\" \"12 Park Lane\" =address error:=(tried&&trim(address)==\"\")?\"Address is required\":\"\"\n      InputField \"City\" \"London\" =city error:=(tried&&trim(city)==\"\")?\"City is required\":\"\"\n      InputField \"Postcode\" \"N1 9GU\" =postcode error:=(tried&&trim(postcode)==\"\")?\"Postcode is required\":\"\"\n      InputField \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email keyboard:\"email\" error:=(tried&&trim(email)==\"\")?\"Email is required\":((tried&&!contains(email,\"@\"))?\"Email must contain @\":\"\")\n      Row gap:10\n        ActionButton \"Back\" tone:\"quiet\" -> step=1\n        ActionButton \"Continue\" -> tried=true; step=(trim(name)!=\"\"&&trim(address)!=\"\"&&trim(city)!=\"\"&&trim(postcode)!=\"\"&&contains(email,\"@\"))?3:2\n    if step==3\n      SectionLabel \"Delivery\" \"Pick one\"\n      OptionList \"Delivery method\" =ship options:[\"Standard\",\"Express\"] details:[\"3 to 5 working days\",\"Next working day\"] prices:[\"$4\",\"$12\"]\n      Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\",ship==\"Express\"?\"$12.00\":\"$4.00\"],[\"Ship to\",name+\", \"+city]]\n      TotalBar \"Total\" \"Subtotal plus delivery\" amount:=money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)+(ship==\"Express\"?12:4),\"$\",2) cta:\"Pay now\" -> placed=true\n      ActionButton \"Back\" tone:\"quiet\" -> step=2\n  if placed\n    Receipt \"Order confirmed\" \"Thank you, {name}. A confirmation goes to {email}.\" code:\"ORD-48213\" codeLabel:\"Order number\" tone:\"good\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Name\",name],[\"Email\",email],[\"Delivery\",ship],[\"Total paid\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)+(ship==\"Express\"?12:4),\"$\",2)]]","usage":{"input_tokens":9136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1373,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":772,"totalMs":7433}}
